    <section xml:id="sec-section-6-4">
      <title>Section 46 - Double Integrals Over a Polar Rectangular Region</title>
      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Express a region of the plane in terms of polar coordinates.
    </li>
    <li>
      Evaluate a double integral in polar coordinates by using an iterated integral.
    </li>
    <li>
      Convert an integral from rectangular to polar coordinates and evaluate.
    </li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

